# GUI / Menu 开发（Forge 1.14.4）

## Decision: 是否需要 Container

```
IF 交互时需要持久数据存储（机器进度、箱子物品）
  → 使用 Container + IInventory + ContainerScreen

IF 只是显示 UI（无数据）
  → 直接使用 Screen（无需 Container）

IF 需要物品栏槽位（多格容器）
  → Container（slot 管理 + transferStackInSlot）
```

## 架构概览

```
玩家右键方块
    → Block.onBlockActivated()  [服务端]
    → NetworkHooks.openGui()    [服务端]
    → Container 构造             [服务端]
    → ScreenManager 创建 Screen  [客户端]
    → ContainerScreen 渲染        [客户端]
```

## 方块实现 onBlockActivated

```java
public class MyMachineBlock extends Block {
    @Override
    public boolean onBlockActivated(World world, BlockPos pos, BlockState state,
            PlayerEntity player, Hand hand, RayTraceResult hit) {
        if (!world.isRemote) {
            TileEntity tile = world.getTileEntity(pos);
            if (tile instanceof MyMachineTileEntity) {
                // 打开 GUI
                NetworkHooks.openGui((ServerPlayerEntity) player, tile);
            }
        }
        return true;
    }
}
```

## IInventory 实现（TileEntity）

```java
public class MyMachineTileEntity extends TileEntity implements IInventory {
    private ItemStack[] inventory = new ItemStack[9];

    public MyMachineTileEntity() {
        super(TileEntityType.byId(0)); // 实际使用注册的 TileEntityType
    }

    // ===== IInventory 接口 =====
    @Override public int getSizeInventory() { return 9; }
    @Override public boolean isEmpty() {
        for (ItemStack s : inventory) if (!s.isEmpty()) return false;
        return true;
    }
    @Override public ItemStack getStackInSlot(int index) { return inventory[index]; }
    @Override public ItemStack decrStackSize(int index, int count) {
        ItemStack stack = getStackInSlot(index);
        if (!stack.isEmpty()) {
            if (stack.getCount() <= count) {
                setInventorySlotContents(index, ItemStack.EMPTY);
            } else {
                stack.shrink(count);
            }
        }
        return stack;
    }
    @Override public void setInventorySlotContents(int index, ItemStack stack) {
        inventory[index] = stack;
        if (!stack.isEmpty() && stack.getCount() > getInventoryStackLimit()) {
            stack.setCount(getInventoryStackLimit());
        }
        this.markDirty();
    }
    @Override public int getInventoryStackLimit() { return 64; }
    @Override public boolean isUsableByPlayer(PlayerEntity player) { return true; }
    @Override public void openInventory(PlayerEntity player) {}
    @Override public void closeInventory(PlayerEntity player) {}
    @Override public boolean isItemValidForSlot(int index, ItemStack stack) { return true; }
    @Override public void clear() { for (int i = 0; i < 9; i++) inventory[i] = ItemStack.EMPTY; }
}
```

## Container 实现

```java
public class MyMachineContainer extends Container {
    private final IInventory tileInventory;

    public MyMachineContainer(int windowId, PlayerInventory playerInv, IInventory tileInv) {
        super(null, windowId); // ContainerType 在注册时指定
        this.tileInventory = tileInv;

        // 机器物品栏（3行3列）
        for (int row = 0; row < 3; row++) {
            for (int col = 0; col < 3; col++) {
                int slot = col + row * 3;
                int x = 8 + col * 18;
                int y = 18 + row * 18;
                this.addSlot(new Slot(tileInv, slot, x, y));
            }
        }

        // 玩家物品栏（上方3行）
        for (int row = 0; row < 3; row++) {
            for (int col = 0; col < 9; col++) {
                int slot = col + row * 9;
                int x = 8 + col * 18;
                int y = 58 + row * 18;
                this.addSlot(new Slot(playerInv, slot, x, y));
            }
        }

        // 玩家快捷栏（下方1行）
        for (int col = 0; col < 9; col++) {
            this.addSlot(new Slot(playerInv, col, 8 + col * 18, 116));
        }
    }

    // Shift-点击物品转移
    @Override
    public ItemStack transferStackInSlot(PlayerEntity player, int index) {
        ItemStack stack = ItemStack.EMPTY;
        Slot slot = this.inventorySlots.get(index);
        if (slot != null && slot.getHasStack()) {
            ItemStack stack1 = slot.getStack();
            stack = stack1.copy();

            if (index < 9) { // 从机器到玩家
                if (!this.mergeItemStack(stack1, 9, 45, true)) {
                    return ItemStack.EMPTY;
                }
                slot.onSlotChange(stack1, stack);
            } else { // 从玩家到机器
                if (!this.mergeItemStack(stack1, 0, 9, false)) {
                    return ItemStack.EMPTY;
                }
            }

            if (stack1.isEmpty()) {
                slot.putStack(ItemStack.EMPTY);
            } else {
                slot.onSlotChanged();
            }
        }
        return stack;
    }

    @Override
    public boolean canInteractWith(PlayerEntity player) {
        return tileInventory.isUsableByPlayer(player);
    }
}
```

## ContainerType 注册

```java
public static final ContainerType<MyMachineContainer> MY_MACHINE_CONTAINER =
    IForgeContainerType.create((windowId, playerInv, extraData) -> {
        World world = playerInv.player.world;
        TileEntity tile = world.getTileEntity(extraData.readBlockPos());
        if (tile instanceof MyMachineTileEntity) {
            return new MyMachineContainer(windowId, playerInv, (IInventory) tile);
        }
        return null;
    });

@SubscribeEvent
public static void onContainerRegistry(final RegistryEvent.Register<IContainer>> event) {
    event.getRegistry().register(
        MY_MACHINE_CONTAINER.setRegistryName(new ResourceLocation(MOD_ID, "my_machine"))
    );
}
```

## Screen 客户端实现

```java
public class MyMachineScreen extends ContainerScreen<MyMachineContainer> {
    public MyMachineScreen(MyMachineContainer container, PlayerInventory playerInv, ITextComponent title) {
        super(container, playerInv, title);
        this.guiLeft = 0;
        this.guiTop = 0;
        this.xSize = 176;
        this.ySize = 165;
    }

    @Override
    protected void drawGuiContainerBackgroundLayer(float partialTicks, int mouseX, int mouseY) {
        // 绘制背景 PNG
        this.blit(this.guiLeft, this.guiTop, 0, 0, this.xSize, this.ySize);
    }

    @Override
    protected void drawGuiContainerForegroundLayer(int mouseX, int mouseY) {
        // 绘制文字
        this.font.drawString(this.guiLeft + 8, this.guiTop + 6, "My Machine", 0x404040);
    }
}
```

## Screen 注册（客户端）

```java
@Mod.EventBusSubscriber(modid = MOD_ID, value = Dist.CLIENT, bus = Mod.EventBusSubscriber.Bus.MOD)
public class ClientSetup {
    @SubscribeEvent
    public static void init(FMLClientSetupEvent event) {
        ScreenManager.registerFactory(
            ModContainers.MY_MACHINE_CONTAINER,
            MyMachineScreen::new
        );
    }
}
```

## 常见错误

- ❌ `Container` vs `AbstractContainerMenu`：1.14.4 用 `Container`
- ❌ `IInventory` vs `Container`：1.14.4 用 `IInventory`
- ❌ `IContainer` vs `ContainerType`：注意类名
- ❌ `ScreenManager`（1.14.4）vs `MenuScreens`（1.16.5+）
- ❌ `transferStackInSlot` 返回空导致物品消失：必须完整实现
- ❌ `canInteractWith` 返回 false：GUI 无法打开
- ❌ 在客户端构造 Container（Container 在服务端构造）
- ❌ 忘记在 `IInventory.setInventorySlotContents` 中调用 `markDirty()`
